WEBVTT

00:00:18.070 --> 00:00:23.810
<i>Every day I keep wondering if</i>
<i>there's something missing.</i>

00:00:25.310 --> 00:00:31.150
<i>I still want to keep feeling my</i>
<i>heart beating in anticipation.</i>

00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:38.920
<i>Ideals are far out of reach, but</i>
<i>reality is within my grasp.</i>

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:44.960
<i>It's not easy standing against the wind,</i>
<i>but as long as I keep smiling...</i>

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:49.740
<i>... staying true to myself,</i>
<i>I'll become stronger.</i>

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:57.510
<i>I know I'll love somebody. Someday</i>
<i>I'll find him and take my chance.</i>

00:00:57.580 --> 00:01:04.480
<i>I'll make the whole world stop</i>
<i>to see the angel that I'll be.</i>

00:01:04.550 --> 00:01:12.420
<i>I know I'll love somebody. Someday</i>
<i>I'll meet the man of my dreams.</i>

00:01:12.520 --> 00:01:20.090
<i>Nothing can slow me down. Tomorrow</i>
<i>is just around the corner.</i>

00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:31.500
FILE. 39
AH! THE SPRINGTIME OF
BEACH VOLLEYBALL
MAN'S YOUTH

00:01:32.110 --> 00:01:34.010
Aah!

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:35.910
We're so
late!

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:39.150
I said not to stay up drinking all night!

00:01:39.150 --> 00:01:42.640
I had to! I couldn't switch days off!

00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:44.680
There you
go again.

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:46.390
Forget it, I'm leaving you behind.

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:48.420
No, wait for me, Miyuki!

00:01:48.730 --> 00:01:50.700
I won't make it if you
leave me behind!

00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:53.420
Summers in Japan are meant to be
enjoyed by young people, like me!

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:59.030
They should've been
here by now.

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:01.200
Natsumi must have
slept in again.

00:02:01.370 --> 00:02:03.930
We probably should have woken
her up on our way.

00:02:04.110 --> 00:02:06.700
Well, at least they've
got their tickets.

00:02:06.880 --> 00:02:09.720
Unreal. I already made the arrangements.

00:02:09.720 --> 00:02:11.080
Huh? What arrangements?

00:02:11.080 --> 00:02:14.680
Oops, uh, nothing. Forget it.

00:02:19.290 --> 00:02:20.060
Only five minutes left!

00:02:20.060 --> 00:02:22.030
My perfect summer day!

00:02:25.900 --> 00:02:28.870
Great! Maybe we'll
make it after all!

00:02:30.140 --> 00:02:32.540
Fantastic! Just what
we needed.

00:02:32.700 --> 00:02:34.540
This is an emergency! Let's go for it!

00:02:34.540 --> 00:02:37.510
You're a policewoman, Natsumi.

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:38.380
Come off it!

00:02:38.380 --> 00:02:40.500
You're too much.

00:02:40.780 --> 00:02:41.750
That man's a weirdo.

00:02:41.750 --> 00:02:43.720
It's not nice to stare, dear.

00:02:51.590 --> 00:02:56.250
What a perfect disguise. No
one will recognize... Hmm?

00:02:58.660 --> 00:03:02.620
Uh, excuse me? I beg your pardon...
I was wondering...

00:03:07.810 --> 00:03:11.140
The elderly are the jewels of Japan!
Such disdain is unforgivable!

00:03:11.510 --> 00:03:15.140
Our country's future
is at stake!

00:03:15.510 --> 00:03:18.310
This is inexcusable!

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:20.510
Prepare yourselves,
oblivious masses!

00:03:20.990 --> 00:03:23.250
I will bestow punishment
from the heavens!

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:26.320
My name is
Strike Man!

00:03:26.490 --> 00:03:28.890
And here,
I strike!

00:03:35.670 --> 00:03:40.870
Everyone grows old. Feel the
despair of your tomorrow!

00:03:44.710 --> 00:03:47.840
Stop where you are, you
cowardly fiends!

00:03:50.220 --> 00:03:52.080
We're going to make it! We're safe!

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:53.950
You're out!

00:03:55.790 --> 00:03:57.120
Hmm?

00:03:57.120 --> 00:03:58.760
It's Strike Man!

00:03:58.760 --> 00:04:00.590
What's he doing here?

00:04:01.290 --> 00:04:05.230
What a coincidence, running into
my archrival, Home Run Girl!

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:08.090
Why do you follow
me so?

00:04:08.670 --> 00:04:10.370
Nobody's following you!

00:04:10.370 --> 00:04:12.960
Nobody's following you!
Stop creating this disturbance!

00:04:13.370 --> 00:04:16.930
Hmm. You must desperately want
to challenge me to a battle.

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:19.010
All right, I accept!

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:21.840
Hang on, buster, who
said... Well...

00:04:22.350 --> 00:04:26.310
My rival, Home Run Girl! I will claim
victory over you this time!

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:29.580
We'll settle this, once
and for all!

00:04:33.260 --> 00:04:36.790
All right. But you'll
be sorry.

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:38.930
We don't have time for this.

00:04:38.930 --> 00:04:40.020
Prepare yourself!

00:04:40.200 --> 00:04:42.170
I'm ready for you!

00:04:45.370 --> 00:04:46.560
Fooled ya!

00:04:46.740 --> 00:04:47.640
Huh?!

00:04:47.810 --> 00:04:51.470
I don't have time for this
today! See you!

00:04:51.780 --> 00:04:53.450
Hey, wait!

00:04:53.450 --> 00:04:55.410
We're gonna miss the train!

00:05:07.460 --> 00:05:09.530
Oh! We missed it!

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:11.720
The summer of my youth!

00:05:11.900 --> 00:05:13.870
Who's fault
is this?!

00:05:14.030 --> 00:05:16.000
Mine.

00:05:34.220 --> 00:05:39.950
Okay, I apologize!
Yoriko! Aoi!

00:05:40.330 --> 00:05:46.960
Yep, you should've buried me lying
down. I can't get out. Help!

00:05:47.230 --> 00:05:50.720
I'm baking here!
I'm gonna die!

00:05:50.900 --> 00:05:51.740
Okay.

00:05:51.740 --> 00:05:52.700
Oh!

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:55.470
I guess that means you're buying lunch.

00:05:55.570 --> 00:05:58.480
See? I told you, you can't get out
if you're buried standing up.

00:05:58.810 --> 00:06:01.680
All right, all ready! Now just
get me out of here!

00:06:02.050 --> 00:06:05.210
I can't get you out by myself. I'll
have to wait until Aoi gets back.

00:06:05.780 --> 00:06:08.480
Great. Where'd she
take off to?

00:06:08.650 --> 00:06:12.210
To the change room. She bought
a brand new bikini.

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:14.380
A bikini? But
her!

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:15.720
Uh-oh!

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:17.730
Aah!

00:06:17.900 --> 00:06:19.730
"Change Room"

00:06:21.570 --> 00:06:22.590
No doubt
about it.

00:06:22.700 --> 00:06:25.970
It's better for young ladies like myself
to cover up the front like this.

00:06:34.510 --> 00:06:36.450
There! All
set!

00:06:36.550 --> 00:06:38.910
The "V" symbol, shining
over my brow!

00:06:39.020 --> 00:06:43.820
With this mask, I'm transformed
into the Beach Volleyball Man!

00:06:44.490 --> 00:06:46.750
The man my youthful comrades
have been anticipating.

00:06:46.860 --> 00:06:48.830
Behold... huh?!

00:06:51.130 --> 00:06:53.030
Hey, don't I?

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:55.190
No, you must be
mistaken, miss.

00:06:55.300 --> 00:06:59.900
I'm certain I haven't had the pleasure
of meeting you before. Excuse me.

00:07:00.910 --> 00:07:02.400
Uh... Umm...

00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:05.840
I could swear
that's him.

00:07:15.290 --> 00:07:17.120
We finally
made it.

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:20.550
Thank you, Lord.

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:23.630
All right! Time
to live it up!

00:07:34.170 --> 00:07:35.940
What a drag.

00:07:36.040 --> 00:07:39.940
How are we ever going
to find them?

00:07:40.110 --> 00:07:43.210
Yeah, we'll never spot
them in this crowd!

00:07:43.380 --> 00:07:44.980
What happened to our luck?

00:07:44.980 --> 00:07:47.950
All we're gonna get is that.

00:07:50.290 --> 00:07:51.590
What'll we do?

00:07:51.590 --> 00:07:53.180
How should I know?

00:07:53.360 --> 00:07:54.330
There you are!

00:07:54.460 --> 00:07:54.890
Huh?

00:07:54.890 --> 00:07:58.120
Hi! You sure took your time!

00:07:58.300 --> 00:08:01.270
Thank goodness! I thought
we'd never find you!

00:08:01.730 --> 00:08:04.000
How'd you spot
us, anyway?

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:05.340
It was a snap.

00:08:05.340 --> 00:08:08.000
All we had to do was find a swarm of guys!

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:12.080
What, I'm the flame drawing
the moth now? Man!

00:08:12.180 --> 00:08:13.200
Hey, what's the
matter?

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:17.340
I was just wondering
where Nakajima is.

00:08:17.520 --> 00:08:19.750
Well, excuse me!

00:08:19.850 --> 00:08:24.580
Your whole purpose here is to spend a nice
summer day with Nakajima, isn't it?

00:08:24.760 --> 00:08:28.060
Sheesh! Why do you say
things like that?!

00:08:28.690 --> 00:08:29.690
Hey, what is that?

00:08:29.690 --> 00:08:31.290
See something?

00:08:31.460 --> 00:08:32.620
Look!

00:08:32.730 --> 00:08:34.700
Riding that wave...

00:08:39.100 --> 00:08:41.630
I've kept you waiting,
my beloved youths!

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:43.510
Isn't that...

00:08:43.510 --> 00:08:44.940
Strike Man!

00:08:45.110 --> 00:08:47.180
What's he doing here?

00:08:47.180 --> 00:08:49.650
How'll this affect our great summer day?

00:08:55.190 --> 00:08:57.310
I am the preacher of
Love and Youth!

00:08:57.420 --> 00:08:59.580
A.k.a. the Beach
Volleyball Man!

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:02.090
The Beach Volleyball Man?

00:09:02.090 --> 00:09:05.090
What're you saying?! You're Strike Man!

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:09.090
Strike Man? Who could
you be referring to?

00:09:09.330 --> 00:09:11.030
Knock off
the act.

00:09:11.140 --> 00:09:14.070
What are you trying to pull
this time, Strike Man?!

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:16.370
You just don't get
it, do you?!

00:09:16.470 --> 00:09:20.810
What do you think I'm doing with
this ball?! And look here!

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:23.470
This "V" stands for
Beach Volleyball!

00:09:23.650 --> 00:09:25.320
So what about it?

00:09:25.320 --> 00:09:27.980
So you're not Strike Man?

00:09:29.020 --> 00:09:33.290
Ah, we meet again, my fair lady. I'm sorry
I wasn't the man you were looking for.

00:09:33.390 --> 00:09:36.830
It seems as though Home Run Girl
here is jumping to conclusions.

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:42.100
Who're you calling Home Run Girl?! You're
the only one who calls me that!

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:45.270
I beg your pardon,
but I'm in a rush.

00:09:45.370 --> 00:09:49.970
I have business to take care
of before sundown.

00:09:50.080 --> 00:09:52.840
We'll meet again,
Home Run Girl.

00:09:53.010 --> 00:09:56.500
Hey, watch what
you call me!

00:09:56.610 --> 00:09:58.580
What?

00:10:03.690 --> 00:10:05.490
That great big idiot!

00:10:09.230 --> 00:10:10.630
He got away again!

00:10:10.800 --> 00:10:14.360
I wonder what he's doing
out here, anyway.

00:10:14.530 --> 00:10:15.400
Mm-hmm.

00:10:15.570 --> 00:10:16.970
I know what.

00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:17.940
I know what.
Yeah?

00:10:18.100 --> 00:10:21.560
As far as I can tell, he
has just one purpose.

00:10:21.670 --> 00:10:22.800
And it's this!

00:10:22.970 --> 00:10:26.010
"Beach Volleyball Death Match"

00:10:26.380 --> 00:10:29.370
The winners get a
week in Hawaii!

00:10:29.550 --> 00:10:32.110
Wow! And it's a
trip for five!

00:10:32.280 --> 00:10:36.280
I knew something like this would happen,
so I've already made the arrangements.

00:10:36.450 --> 00:10:38.480
What do you mean, "something
like this?"

00:10:38.920 --> 00:10:41.220
There certainly are a
lot of flyers around.

00:10:41.390 --> 00:10:45.090
When you made said arrangements, did
you know Strike Man would show up?

00:10:45.260 --> 00:10:47.790
You decided on Hawaii,
didn't you?

00:10:47.970 --> 00:10:50.990
No, it's nothing
like that.

00:10:51.470 --> 00:10:53.740
Who's going in this contest, anyway?

00:10:53.740 --> 00:10:55.500
I'll be teamed up with Natsumi, right?

00:10:56.010 --> 00:10:58.810
Why do we have to do all the hard work?

00:10:58.810 --> 00:11:04.010
You'll win for sure! Hawaii for a full week!

00:11:05.050 --> 00:11:06.450
What should we do, Miyuki?

00:11:06.450 --> 00:11:09.010
I guess we do have to catch Strike Man.

00:11:09.390 --> 00:11:14.620
Right! You'll kill two birds with one stone!
Catch Strike Man and we all go to Hawaii!

00:11:14.730 --> 00:11:16.790
Assuming I'm
invited.

00:11:16.960 --> 00:11:17.500
Well...

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:18.760
I guess it won't hurt.

00:11:18.930 --> 00:11:20.860
Hurray! Hawaii!

00:11:21.030 --> 00:11:21.630
Yoriko!

00:11:21.630 --> 00:11:23.440
Oops. Sorry.

00:11:23.440 --> 00:11:24.400
Dorkwad!

00:11:24.500 --> 00:11:28.370
But who's going to play
on Strike Man's team?

00:11:36.450 --> 00:11:41.180
<i>"I wonder what Miyuki would say</i>
<i>if she saw these pictures."</i>

00:11:41.420 --> 00:11:45.150
<i>"Knock it off, Yoriko! Please,</i>
<i>anything but that!"</i>

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:49.660
<i>"Then you'll go in the</i>
<i>volleyball match?"</i>

00:11:49.890 --> 00:11:52.360
<i>"All right,</i>
<i>I will."</i>

00:11:52.460 --> 00:11:55.020
<i>"But shouldn't I have</i>
<i>a partner...?"</i>

00:11:55.200 --> 00:11:58.640
<i>"Aha! So he's going to</i>
<i>be my partner, is he?"</i>

00:11:59.000 --> 00:12:00.400
<i>"What?!"</i>

00:12:00.570 --> 00:12:02.270
<i>"That's exactly</i>
<i>right!"</i>

00:12:02.370 --> 00:12:05.710
<i>"It's all going to boil down</i>
<i>to your teamwork."</i>

00:12:05.810 --> 00:12:07.780
<i>"Understand?"</i>

00:12:21.390 --> 00:12:24.360
Hello, all you beach
bums out there!

00:12:27.900 --> 00:12:31.770
Today's the day we've been waiting for...
the Beach Volleyball Death Match!

00:12:32.140 --> 00:12:37.770
Which team will be the lucky
winners of a trip to Hawaii?!

00:12:39.140 --> 00:12:41.050
This bathing suit is too tight.

00:12:41.050 --> 00:12:42.410
Gained a little weight?

00:12:42.510 --> 00:12:44.320
Got a little surprise in there?

00:12:44.320 --> 00:12:45.180
Natsumi!

00:12:45.350 --> 00:12:52.020
Here's the one and only women's team,
Tsujimoto and Kobayakawa!

00:12:52.920 --> 00:12:57.020
What a team they make, these
two policewomen!

00:12:57.500 --> 00:12:59.100
What has that Yoriko gotten us unto?

00:12:59.100 --> 00:13:01.600
This is just a freak show.

00:13:01.600 --> 00:13:03.790
How dare you use your sex appeal.

00:13:03.970 --> 00:13:04.830
Oh!

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:08.770
But the Goddess of Victory
will defeat you.

00:13:09.170 --> 00:13:13.540
The one who's going to win will be Beach
Volleyball Man, the champion of youth!

00:13:13.880 --> 00:13:15.510
Listen to him!

00:13:15.510 --> 00:13:17.570
Listen to him!
How do you expect to win by yourself?

00:13:17.880 --> 00:13:23.510
Funny you should ask. I wonder
if you can see, from down there.

00:13:25.520 --> 00:13:27.510
Nakajima!

00:13:27.830 --> 00:13:29.030
What are you doing?

00:13:29.030 --> 00:13:30.790
What are you doing?
Hey! What'd you do to him?!

00:13:31.300 --> 00:13:35.860
This is my faithful servant, Beach
Volleyball Man Number 2!

00:13:35.970 --> 00:13:39.270
Not Nakajima!

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:42.000
No way!

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:43.770
Nakajima!

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:50.780
Listen up, youthful comrades! Burn this
image of Justice into your memories!

00:13:50.950 --> 00:13:54.780
Well, there sure is some strange
posturing going on...

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:59.020
Let the Beach Volleyball
Death Match begin!

00:13:59.390 --> 00:14:02.120
Number 2!

00:14:04.130 --> 00:14:07.430
For the battle of youth, between
Good and Evil!

00:14:12.770 --> 00:14:13.790
Well?

00:14:13.910 --> 00:14:16.500
What do you think of
my youthful power?

00:14:18.980 --> 00:14:23.910
<i>This is no good. I don't want to be</i>
<i>doing this, but I can't help myself!</i>

00:14:25.520 --> 00:14:28.750
<i>The blood of an athlete courses</i>
<i>through my veins!</i>

00:14:28.920 --> 00:14:29.620
Number 2!

00:14:29.620 --> 00:14:30.490
Huh?

00:14:30.490 --> 00:14:33.150
Show them your fury!

00:14:33.260 --> 00:14:36.630
Try and return that,
if you can!

00:14:41.070 --> 00:14:48.100
Hmph. No sympathy here. No one can
stand up to the Beach Volleyball Man!

00:14:52.510 --> 00:14:53.110
Natsumi!

00:14:53.110 --> 00:14:53.540
Here goes!

00:14:53.880 --> 00:14:56.810
My Gravity-Shattering
Spike!

00:14:58.280 --> 00:15:01.340
Set! Two-nothing, for Tsujimoto
and Kobayakawa!

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:05.560
That's one down!

00:15:05.560 --> 00:15:07.820
Hey, this is kind of fun.

00:15:10.900 --> 00:15:13.830
Everyone's being seduced
by their beauty!

00:15:14.100 --> 00:15:17.340
Stop this! Don't be led astray!

00:15:17.340 --> 00:15:19.400
Look, it's already started.

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:20.840
You see what I see?

00:15:21.110 --> 00:15:22.830
What do you think
you're doing?!

00:15:23.010 --> 00:15:28.040
What's Nakajima doing with
Strike Man, anyway?

00:15:28.250 --> 00:15:28.580
"Victory"

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:32.350
The team that wins will either be the
strongest, or have the best skills.
"Victory"

00:15:32.350 --> 00:15:32.420
"Victory"

00:15:32.420 --> 00:15:34.990
Either way... I'll get
to go to Hawaii!

00:15:34.990 --> 00:15:37.490
"Hawaii"

00:15:37.490 --> 00:15:40.890
Ooh, I'm so
lucky!
"Hawaii"

00:15:41.390 --> 00:15:42.960
So you're behind this, huh?

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:44.790
Come on you guys, win, win, win!

00:16:04.650 --> 00:16:07.680
Game, to Tsujimoto
and Kobayakawa.

00:16:13.960 --> 00:16:16.860
What a tournament this is!
And the finalists are...

00:16:16.860 --> 00:16:17.330
"Beach Volleyball Men #1 and #2"
What a tournament this is!
And the finalists are...

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:19.100
...the Beach Volleyball Men versus
the Bokuto Station Pair!

00:16:19.100 --> 00:16:20.690
"Bokuto Station Pair"

00:16:21.200 --> 00:16:23.770
Whoopee! I'm on my way to Hawaii!

00:16:23.770 --> 00:16:25.100
Come on, you guys!

00:16:32.240 --> 00:16:38.340
You've made it thus far, Home Run Girl.
Considering your makeshift team.

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:40.450
Oh! Nakajima!

00:16:40.620 --> 00:16:45.110
You're gravely mistaken if you think things
will always go your way, Strike Man!

00:16:45.620 --> 00:16:49.350
Don't make me say it again! I'm the
Beach Volleyball Man, Number 1!

00:16:49.960 --> 00:16:54.630
Tsujimoto, Kobayakawa! Forgive me, but
I'm the Beach Volleyball Man, Number 2!

00:16:55.070 --> 00:16:56.500
Oh, God...

00:16:56.670 --> 00:16:59.440
He's sure sunk his teeth into this.

00:16:59.440 --> 00:17:03.070
He's sure sunk his teeth into this.
Well, we'll just have to play along with it.

00:17:03.240 --> 00:17:05.000
Looks like.

00:17:05.110 --> 00:17:08.510
Beach Volleyball Men! I'd like
to place a little bet with you!

00:17:09.050 --> 00:17:13.480
If you lose, you take off your mask and
come quietly with me. All right?

00:17:14.020 --> 00:17:15.750
Aha! Well in
that case...

00:17:15.850 --> 00:17:19.980
...if you two lose, you take
off your bathing suits!

00:17:20.320 --> 00:17:21.290
What?!

00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:27.330
Yeah! Take it off!
Woo-hoo!

00:17:27.630 --> 00:17:28.500
No way!

00:17:28.670 --> 00:17:31.900
I'm not going to make that kind of bet!

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:33.730
Not that.

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:39.240
And the stakes are high, in what's
become an unmasking match!

00:17:39.410 --> 00:17:41.480
Wait a sec, I haven't agreed to...

00:17:41.480 --> 00:17:43.240
What do you guys... Huh?

00:17:43.880 --> 00:17:46.370
That's not
fair!

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:52.450
Looks like they're
all on our side.

00:17:52.560 --> 00:17:54.490
Referee, let the
game begin!

00:17:54.660 --> 00:17:57.130
This isn't for you
to decide!

00:17:57.600 --> 00:18:02.120
Get a taste of my Viva
la Youth Serve!

00:18:02.470 --> 00:18:04.440
Okay, we'll show him! Miyuki!

00:18:04.440 --> 00:18:06.400
Okay, we'll show him! Miyuki!
Unbelievable!

00:18:10.070 --> 00:18:13.240
He tricked
us!

00:18:16.010 --> 00:18:19.780
No sympathy here! Our
victory is certain!

00:18:20.850 --> 00:18:23.340
Think you're going all the way
to the top, don't you?

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:25.620
Your arrogance has to get
through us, first!

00:18:25.790 --> 00:18:28.060
This is great! Go for it!

00:18:28.060 --> 00:18:28.230
This is great! Go for it!
One's just as good as the other.

00:18:28.230 --> 00:18:28.360
One's just as good as the other.

00:18:28.360 --> 00:18:30.520
Go for it! Hawaii! Hawaii!!
One's just as good as the other.

00:18:30.800 --> 00:18:34.030
Super Space Galaxy
Attack!

00:18:37.700 --> 00:18:40.670
What?! Then have a taste
of my Fireball Spike!

00:18:59.020 --> 00:19:00.490
Sorry, Kobayakawa!

00:19:00.590 --> 00:19:05.890
I'm an athlete and I can't stop
myself! I'm going for it!

00:19:09.170 --> 00:19:11.100
All right! Just one more point!

00:19:11.100 --> 00:19:12.870
Damn it!

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:14.870
This is it, Miyuki! Let's do it!

00:19:14.870 --> 00:19:16.100
Okay!

00:19:16.440 --> 00:19:18.600
Curve Ball
Attack!

00:19:22.010 --> 00:19:23.980
Natsumi!

00:19:26.880 --> 00:19:28.370
Go for it!

00:19:28.550 --> 00:19:31.890
Final Sun Flasher
Spike!

00:19:36.690 --> 00:19:38.230
Nakajima.

00:19:38.230 --> 00:19:40.790
Nakajima.
I'm sorry. Sorry, Kobayakawa.

00:19:40.900 --> 00:19:42.370
I can't let myself
lose!

00:19:44.600 --> 00:19:50.540
Number 2! Now is our chance for a
Final Sun Flasher Spike! Come on!

00:20:08.030 --> 00:20:09.150
Our point!

00:20:11.400 --> 00:20:13.200
Do it!

00:20:13.200 --> 00:20:14.990
Do it!
No!

00:20:26.140 --> 00:20:29.340
Game! To Tsujimoto
and Kobayakawa.

00:20:29.750 --> 00:20:32.810
And the winners are the
Bokuto Station Pair!

00:20:33.020 --> 00:20:34.950
We did it!
We won!

00:20:38.020 --> 00:20:40.080
Okay, Number
1! The mask!

00:20:40.360 --> 00:20:43.330
Summer has ended for the champion
of Love and Youth...

00:20:43.430 --> 00:20:46.490
...the Beach Volleyball
Man.

00:20:46.600 --> 00:20:49.190
The Beach Volleyball Man
will honor his word.

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:58.240
Beach Volleyball Man is dead. It's nice
to meet you, ladies and gentlemen.

00:20:58.340 --> 00:21:01.440
I am Strike Man, fighter
for Justice!

00:21:01.850 --> 00:21:02.740
Hey!

00:21:02.850 --> 00:21:06.080
Why, if it isn't the
Home Run Girl.

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:10.050
Yeah, yeah. I figured you'd
pull something like this.

00:21:10.220 --> 00:21:12.090
He'll never
grow up.

00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:15.720
That's the way the volley-
ball bounces.

00:21:15.890 --> 00:21:21.230
It was a beautiful day! Home Run
Girl! We'll meet again!

00:21:21.400 --> 00:21:25.270
What?! These tickets are only valid
until the end of this month!

00:21:25.370 --> 00:21:30.000
That only leaves three days! We
won't be able to get time off.

00:21:30.170 --> 00:21:37.240
Hawaii, here I come!
Sun, sand, waves!

00:21:37.420 --> 00:21:41.350
Oh, how am I going
to tell them?

00:21:41.620 --> 00:21:46.350
Let's pack
our bags!

00:21:46.520 --> 00:21:52.790
And that's how our summer
day ended.

00:21:56.000 --> 00:22:02.210
<i>Every time I fall</i>
<i>out of love...</i>

00:22:02.270 --> 00:22:09.510
<i>... everything that I see</i>
<i>turns monochrome.</i>

00:22:12.720 --> 00:22:19.010
<i>We often used to go see the</i>
<i>games at the stadium...</i>

00:22:19.120 --> 00:22:28.870
<i>... but the good old days mean</i>
<i>nothing to me anymore.</i>

00:22:32.870 --> 00:22:43.080
<i>Even after you've gone, I still wanna</i>
<i>tell the world what it is that I love.</i>

00:22:43.380 --> 00:22:51.320
<i>Looking up to the sky, I try</i>
<i>holding back the tears.</i>

00:22:51.390 --> 00:22:59.960
<i>Flags were moving in the wind and</i>
<i>things seemed brighter yesterday.</i>

00:23:00.200 --> 00:23:08.040
<i>Looking up to the sky, we used</i>
<i>to talk about our dreams.</i>

00:23:08.110 --> 00:23:17.570
<i>No matter how far out of reach they seemed,</i>
<i>dreams could come true, or so it felt.</i>

00:23:17.980 --> 00:23:25.060
<i>Tell me that that fire in your</i>
<i>eyes was not a lie.</i>

00:23:27.120 --> 00:23:28.460
"To die for love"

00:23:29.430 --> 00:23:31.950
It's been a while since Kobayakawa
and I went out on a date.

00:23:32.060 --> 00:23:35.520
But why, oh why, must such
a special day...

00:23:35.630 --> 00:23:38.500
...end in... end like
that... Oh!

00:23:38.940 --> 00:23:41.000
God knows who could've...

00:23:41.110 --> 00:23:43.160
...predicted such an end!

00:23:44.440 --> 00:23:46.910
Next time, You're Under
Arrest, File 40...

00:23:47.080 --> 00:23:48.810
..."Three Couples' Dangerous Date."

00:23:48.950 --> 00:23:50.950
Miyuki! Behind you!
